**touch.hpp defines touchpad sample data for unstable gamepad controllers.**

## Symbols

- `touch_point`: `{ bool active{false}; uint8_t id{0}; uint16_t x{0}; uint16_t y{0}; }`; `x/y` use device resolution, `id` tracks contacts, and inactive fields are stale.
- `touchpad`: `{ static constexpr size_t max_points{2}; array<touch_point, max_points> points{}; }`; absent hardware uses an empty sample `optional`, distinct from inactive contacts.

## Dependencies

`types.hpp` supplies `uint8_t`, `uint16_t`, `size_t`, and `array`; `utility.hpp` supplies related utility definitions.